The failing clamp test in `src/clamp.ts` was caused by incomplete logic (it only checked the lower bound). I have updated `src/clamp.ts` to correctly implement clamping between `min` and `max`.

The fix is complete and verified:
```bash
$ bun test
bun test v1.4.0 (34cbb9a40)

src/clamp.test.ts:
(pass) clamps below, within, and above the range [0.15ms]

 1 pass
 0 fail
 3 expect() calls
Ran 1 test across 1 file. [4.00ms]
```
The tests passed successfully.
